  <developer id="io.github.hugomonizdorego">
    <name>Selviana DE Project</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>SDE Welcome opens at the first login and guides through setting up the computer: light or dark colors and the accent, the panel layout and its Show desktop button, system updates, drivers and firmware, system snapshots with Timeshift, the firewall, multimedia codecs and a software center.</p>
    <p>It also links to the documentation, the bug tracker, System Reports and the ways to contribute or donate. A switch turns it off at startup.</p>
    <p>The welcome screen concept follows Linux Mint's; SDE Welcome is written from scratch by the Selviana DE Project for the Selviana Desktop Environment.</p>
  </description>
